            "review_text": "rebecca B\n4 contributions\n0\nWhat a lovely new gem! ✨\nMay 2026 • Friends\nI recently visited this newly opened restaurant and was genuinely charmed by the whole experience. The atmosphere is cozy, stylish, and very welcoming — \nThe food was fresh, delicious, and clearly prepared with care. Every dish was beautifully presented. The team was also extremely friendly and attentive, which made the experience even more enjoyable.\na place with such a great vibe \nDefinitely worth visiting if you are looking for a cute spot with good food and a warm ambiance. Looking forward to coming back soon!\nRead more\nWritten May 10, 2026\nCabri Eatery\nThank you so much for your lovely words! ✨\n\nWe’re so happy to hear that your visit to Cabri felt cozy, welcoming, and full of good vibes. It means a lot to know you enjoyed the food, the atmosphere, and the care our team put into your evening.\n\nAs a newly opened spot, messages like this truly encourage us. We can’t wait to welcome you back soon for more good food, easy wines, and warm moments at Cabri.\n\nWith love,\nCabri Team\nRead more\nWritten June 2, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
