            "review_text": "charles d\n8 contributions\n0\nPleasant evening at Cabri\nMay 2026 • Friends\nGreat place with a nice atmosphere and friendly staff. The food was good and the service smooth. Overall a very pleasant experience, I would definitely come back!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 6, 2026\nCabri Eatery\nThank you so much for your kind review!\n\nWe’re very happy to hear that you had a pleasant evening at Cabri and enjoyed the atmosphere, food, and service. Our team truly appreciates your lovely words, and it means a lot to know you would come back.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you again soon for another easy and enjoyable night at Cabri.\n\nWarmly,\nCabri Team\nRead more\nWritten June 2, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
