            "review_text": "Milo J\n1 contribution\n0\nRestaurant Cabri is Top\nMay 2026 • Friends\nI love it! \nIt is a very nice place. \nThe Roman Chief is Top. \nYoung and experienced. \nI strongly advise.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten May 6, 2026\nCabri Eatery\nThank you so much for your lovely review!\n\nWe’re so happy to hear that you loved your experience at Cabri. Your kind words about our place and Chef Romain mean a lot to us — young, passionate, and experienced is exactly the spirit we’re proud to share.\n\nThank you again for recommending us. We look forward to welcoming you back soon for another great time at Cabri.\n\nWarmly,\nCabri Team\nRead more\nWritten June 2, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
